        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The vast lands of the frontier still have considerable potential for development, and we earnestly invite everyone whose talents have not yet been put to their best use to join us out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Interview Guest"
    },
    {
        "text": "But for those who remain steadfastly committed to their hometowns, we've also been preparing a plate redevelopment plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Interview Guest"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what is this plan, exactly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "For certain plates that have not been meeting industrial benchmarks, we've thought up redevelopment plans to give them a brand new image. The high-tech industries attracted by the state government will make use of these valuable plates to expand their cutting-edge businesses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Interview Guest"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exciting news! I'm sure all the residents of those plates can't wait to see the bright new future that awaits them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "We already have concrete plans for a number of them, including Bayswood, Deadhorse, and Davistown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Interview Guest"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wonder if anyone in the audience is tuning in from any of those plates? I'm sure it'll be the best news they've heard all year, haha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "42_g9_modernoffice",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Cliff, you wouldn't believe how excited I am to see the splendor of Fort Barron with my own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too kind. It's our honor to work with a company like yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha! If at all possible, I would like to continue our partnership across other business ventures, out in the frontier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was just thinking the same thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's always a pleasure to speak with you, and I hope that never changes. After all, towing is a long process, and we might not be parting ways until the snow melts in the spring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Too soon, if you ask me. A true pity\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir! Sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, let me in! I have something urgent to report!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ever need anything, my door is always open\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Please open the door, sir! It's an emergency! I'm begging you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sounds like you have urgent matters to attend to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me just a minute.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glassdooropen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$formal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here, Jessica? Who gave you permission to come yelling and banging on my door?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "My apologies, sir, but the contents of Jessica's report are, in fact, urgent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Secretary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That man over there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "May I use your restroom?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, what exactly was so important that you had to come running to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bank is trying to leverage their deal with the government to make us open fire on a civilian crowd.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And did you do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't say what happened after I left, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way we'd obey that order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I understand. You can leave now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are we going to do about the residents?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's none of your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But can you at least\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you still don't get it, I'll spell it out for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's none of your business, and it's none of mine either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you serious?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what <i>is</i> your business? The massive kickback you're getting from the bank? The extrajudicial privileges that the military grants you? Or is it the feeling you get when you trample people beneath your feet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "The feeling of being superior to others?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cliff narrows his eyes, scanning the now-unfamiliar mercenary before him from head to toe."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm in my nineties, Jessica. It takes more than that to get me excited.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why, then...? What do you get from surrounding yourself with these people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can I <i>not</i> have suspicions? The way I see it... you've thrown away almost all of your humanity, and for what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Humanity... It's a word that means less and less to me as I get older. Blacksteel is a PMC, and I'm the boss. What do I need pretty words for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "To put it another way, Jessica, if those are the things you value so much, what are <i>you</i> doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember what your father once told me. That you wanted to resolve conflicts and protect others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, why not become a police officer, a judge, or a peacekeeper? And if all else fails, you could at least become a soldier to protect your family and country, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you chose mercenary. A job that uses force for money. A job that's inseparable from death and violence. A job that's devoid of glory or honor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I know you're not short on cash either, so I ask you again, Jessica\u2014what are you even doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you haven't figured it out yet, then I can always give you my answer. Because I have one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ambition... For the sake of my own ambitions. To prove that I'm no less than my brothers and sisters. To prove... that I am not a mediocre stain on my family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not bad. I like seeing that clarity and self-awareness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "So don't stand there and criticize the way I conduct <i>my</i> business. Your father's also an excellent businessman, and as his daughter, you'd do well to learn from him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need to be more mature, more rational. Less emotional.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Secretary, escort her out. From now on, never let her in again, no matter what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Decades ago, you sat back and watched your friends get taken captive. Decades later, you're doing the same thing as people are being driven from their homes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's what you call a mature, rational, and level-headed choice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'd rather stay naive my entire life. I'd rather remain a mediocre fool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please leave, Miss Brynley.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Secretary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1034_jesca2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't touch me... I can leave on my own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
