    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_176",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I see you've taken care of your business?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I did hear some bad news. Some very, very unfortunate news.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your subordinates gave my people an order to open fire at the entrance of the bank.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without asking, without permission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "And why is that a problem?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have authorization from the government, and you provided us that team. When an urgent situation arises that requires force, I don't see why it's necessary to report our every move to you, line by line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can rest assured that our people will show restraint. But during emergencies, our own needs must come first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think you understand what I'm saying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is very bad news, but not for me. For you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Surely you jest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank President"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_gunload"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1036_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Nobody</i> can go over my head and command <i>my</i> troops. If you really want us to coexist in harmony going forward, you'd best remember those words.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Clip' Cliff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
