        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you finished sorting that batch of documents?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1039_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going through them right now... I- I'll have them ready shortly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... I just saw a repossession document. Leone Theremin just recently sold his shares...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this blank contract prepared for him showed up in a pile of documents dating back more than a decade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's not just this one document. Many of them have been misplaced... and don't have any signatures on them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "They weren't misplaced. They were prepared in advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1039_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, ten years ago... Many of these people hadn't even set foot in the bank yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sylvia, we have a professional actuarial system. Our concern has never been collecting a bit of interest on the loans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank Manager"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always had our eyes on the prize, and that's never changed: everything here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1039_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-That isn't what you told me before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1041_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "True. You aren't part of the inner circle, so it's understandable that you'd be out of the loop. All the more reason to work harder and rise through the ranks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank Manager"
    },
    {
        "text": "But given the current situation... I think you'd best make full use of the opportunity you have before you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bank Manager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
