    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#2$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Woody, where did you go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened to your arm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pushed my luck a little... and they finally put me in my place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Helena, if... if I were to leave this town, would you come with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What'd that guy say to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing... Just proved once and for all that he's still a good-for-nothing bastard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that good-for-nothing bastard is the reason you left Laterano without a second thought, first set foot on Columbian soil, and joined a war that took nearly everything from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ideals he painted back then were so mesmerizing, so tempting... To be a hero, to lead our people to end the war, to build a new paradise, beyond Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how it is for young'uns with their heads in the clouds. Always following whoever shows the most confidence when peddling their dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, Woody, I know... But I ain't even saying you were tricked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just saying you don't have to be ashamed of your past. It don't matter where your journey started, because it brought you here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those mistakes made you who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, you can look back every now and then, but don't you ever regret it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Helena...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Care for a dance, Woody? I can teach you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I was eighteen, some awkward fella taught me these steps. He was a complete fool, through-and-through, but that didn't stop me from loving the dance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I already know how to dance...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? How come I never knew that? Since when?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Since I was little. And of course you didn't know. I never told you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd you learn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...On my way back to the dorms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4104_coldst_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wanna give it a go, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Helena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1034_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It'd be my pleasure, ma'am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Woodrow"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
