    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't you just walk away when you got the order to vacate them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you're disobeying orders, might as well go all the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... What a drama queen. Even the squads that showed up later could tell you were staying behind to make sure it didn't get out of hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So how's your forehead doing? Didn't expect our own people to wear kiddie gloves with the crowd but show no mercy to their coworkers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine, just a scratch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "And at the end of the day, we were the first to disobey orders... I didn't know what to do at that point either, so I just went back to the basics. Made sure that nobody got hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, you did a damn good job, Teacher's Pet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, there's something I've been meaning to tell you all day, but never got the chance...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Happy New Year.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me check... Sorry, but it's already past midnight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_106_franka_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, so what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose it's not important. Maybe it just sucks that... I wasn't the one to say it first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_107_liskam_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Happy New Year.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
