        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The heavy iron door shuts tightly, and the mechanism springs into place with the sound of a dull collision, sealing off the smell of ink coming from within."
    },
    {
        "text": "An intoxicating smell."
    },
    {
        "text": "With just one whiff, people will start having wondrous delusions. All their desires can be at their fingertips, and all their regrets can be made right."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1039_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... do you really want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what... do you regret?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1039_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sylvia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sylvia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
