        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*... *cough* *cough*... Go, Sylvie. You can always find another job... I... I'll be fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter... No matter what you do... Your mom... will always be proud of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even... when I'm no longer here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're my pride and joy... forever and always...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Voice"
